      "comment": "HES CHARLIES ANGEL (6) worked to get to the lead and fought on well but found a couple better last time out when resuming over 1690m at this track, beaten 6 metres. Strips fitter now and rates a leading hope in a similar race. MISTER JIMARINGLE (4) produced a better effort last time out when he scored by 6 metres over 1690m here. Needs to be at his best to beat this field but he has the ability to mix it with them. HELLOVATIME (8) is the next elect off a last-start win by 3 metres at Swan Hill over 1750m. KIA ORA BEAUTY (1) should not have any excuses from the favourable draw and must be included in calculations.",
